_exptl_special_details           
;
Data were collected at room temperature and pressure of 0.53(5) GPa
(530000 kPa) with the crystal obtained by the in-situ high-pressure
crystallization technique.
Pressure was determined by monitoring the shift of the ruby
R1-fluorescence line.

;

